From 3ade5931bb08e939eeeb0ad1cdfa3229ad6c0f88 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Weidong Sun <sunweidong@linux.alibaba.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 15:29:33 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] alibabacloud: attach retained ESSD data disks

Validate requested disk identities and attachment compatibility before
mutation. Attach them as retained non-bootable data disks and reconcile
ambiguous responses before handing the ready instance back to CAA.

Co-authored-by: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
